Output directory for the LNCS build.

The pre-scan in lncs-switch.tex copies every marked block of main.tex into
<jobname>-lncs-app-<name>.tex / <jobname>-lncs-stmt-<Name>.tex in this folder,
regenerated at every run and safe to delete.  TeX cannot create the folder
itself, so this file is tracked to keep it in git: without it the LNCS build
stops with "I can't write on file `lncs-blocks/...'".

The full (article) build does not use this folder.
